  "description": "The proposed alteration includes the 'like for like' replacement of wooden bay, casement windows (with top sash) in the living room and wooden casement window in the kitchen (with top sash), in the flat located on the first floor (Flat D) of 21 Eliot Park. \nThe new windows will match the existing windows with the addition of double glazing panels providing no visual difference to the property:\n•\tFrame material: timber – no change \n•\tColour: white – no change, \n•\tWindow appearance from the street – no change,\n•\tFrame thickness will be the same but may not be 100% match – minor difference, \n•\tNumber or windows: 8 units in bay window (and top sash) and 2 units in kitchen window (and top sash) – no change, \n•\tOpening windows - no change, \n•\tTrickle vents will be included in the aluminium window frames to ensure proper ventilation. Currently, there is no ventilation in original window frames. Vents will be slightly visible from the outside – minor difference",
